// t_36492ad8 commit 2.  Measured against sce-cgc 475.
// GAP ROW, card t_3aa92146 - AND THE ROW THAT MAKES fp_helper_default_prefer_f
// HONEST.  The reference accepts a float4 argument for a float3 parameter with
// "warning C7011: implicit cast"; we have no such conversion and refuse.
//
// That is why the prefer row passes for us today: f(float3) is not viable at
// all, so the defaulted float4 overload wins by ELIMINATION, not because we
// rank a default fill above a narrowing conversion.  When t_3aa92146 lands,
// this row goes red - and whoever fixes it must then re-examine prefer, which
// only becomes a real preference test at that moment.
float4 f(float3 v) { return float4(v, 1) * 2.0; }
float4 main(float4 t : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR { return f(t); }
